# Cached sources for issue #35 that carry no open licence. Neither the PDFs nor their
# text extracts are committed: the extracts are kept on disk only, for re-checking the
# locators in literature/portable-rules/ (the other refs/pr_*.txt ARE tracked).
# To rebuild an extract: re-download, then `pdftotext -enc UTF-8 <pdf> <txt>`.
#   IG 2.0 accepted manuscript: https://hdl.handle.net/11250/3032234 (NTNU, via NVA)
#   Co-simulation survey, accepted version: https://people.kth.se/~dbro/papers/gomes-et-al-2018-co-simulation-survey.pdf
#   Aligning simulation models, preprint: https://public.websites.umich.edu/~axe/research/Aligning_Sim.pdf
refs/pr_frantz2021_ig2_padm_accepted.pdf
refs/pr_frantz2021_ig2_padm_accepted.txt
refs/pr_gomes2018_cosim_survey_accepted.pdf
refs/pr_gomes2018_cosim_survey_accepted.txt
refs/pr_axtell1995_aligning_preprint.pdf
refs/pr_axtell1995_aligning_preprint.txt
