# Cached sources for issue #36 that carry no open licence (copyright of the publisher,
# standards body or project). Kept on disk only, text included, for re-checking the
# locators in literature/unseen-scenarios/ (the other refs/us_* files ARE tracked:
# arXiv, CC-licensed, or US-government public domain).
# To rebuild: re-download; PDFs with `pdftotext -enc UTF-8 [-layout] <pdf> <txt>`,
# HTML pages saved and stripped of tags.
#   ODD second update (JASSS 23(2) 7): https://www.jasss.org/23/2/7.html
#   OpenSCENARIO XML 1.4.0 sections 7.2 and 7.6: https://openscenario.asam.net/ASAM_OpenSCENARIO_XML/v1.4.0/07_components_scenario/07_02_storyboard_entities.html (and 07_06_conditions_triggers.html)
#   JuPedSim 1.4.2 routing concepts: https://www.jupedsim.org/stable/concepts/routing.html
#   ISO 20414:2020 public page: https://www.iso.org/standard/78348.html
#   IMO MSC.1/Circ.1533: https://www.traffgo-ht.com/downloads/pedestrians/downloads/documents/MSC.1,Circ.1533,2016.pdf
#   IMO MSC.1/Circ.1238: https://dstm.ntou.edu.tw/var/file/71/1071/img/558/MSC.1-Circ.1238-GuidelinesForEvacuationAnalysisForNewAndExistingPassengerShips(Secretariat).pdf
#   SteerBench (CAVW 2009, Wiley copy on a course site): https://ics-websites.science.uu.nl/docs/vakken/mcrws/papers_new/Singh%20et%20al%20-%202009%20-%20SteerBench.pdf
refs/us_odd_grimm2020.txt
refs/us_osc_v1.4.0_*.txt
refs/us_jupedsim_routing.txt
refs/us_iso20414_page.txt
refs/us_imo_circ1533.*
refs/us_imo_circ1238.*
